> algebra.dnf(expr)
  -> OR(AND(Symbol('a'), Symbol('c')), AND(Symbol('a'), Symbol('d')), AND(Symbol('b'), Symbol('c')), AND(Symbol('b'), Symbol('d')))
  str: (a&c)|(a&d)|(b&c)|(b&d)
> parse('(a & b) | (c & d)')
  -> OR(AND(Symbol('a'), Symbol('b')), AND(Symbol('c'), Symbol('d')))
  str: (a&b)|(c&d)
> keep as orig
> algebra.cnf(expr)
  -> AND(OR(Symbol('a'), Symbol('c')), OR(Symbol('a'), Symbol('d')), OR(Symbol('b'), Symbol('c')), OR(Symbol('b'), Symbol('d')))
