    choice GPL-3.0-or-later -> not allowed
    choice MIT + OFL-1.1 -> not allowed
  cryptolib: Apache-2.0&(MIT|BSD-3-Clause)&ISC
    simplified: Apache-2.0&ISC&(BSD-3-Clause|MIT)
    choice Apache-2.0 + BSD-3-Clause + ISC -> allowed
    choice Apache-2.0 + ISC + MIT -> allowed
  jdk-shim: GPL-2.0-only WITH Classpath-exception-2.0
    simplified: GPL-2.0-only WITH Classpath-exception-2.0
    choice GPL-2.0-only WITH Classpath-exception-2.0 -> not allowed
  rustls: Apache-2.0|ISC|MIT
    simplified: Apache-2.0|ISC|MIT
    choice Apache-2.0 -> allowed
    choice ISC -> allowed
    choice MIT -> allowed
  spice: GPL-3.0-only
    simplified: GPL-3.0-only
    choice GPL-3.0-only -> not allowed
  dual: (MIT&mit-0)|(Zlib|BSL-1.0)
    simplified: BSL-1.0|Zlib|(MIT&mit-0)
    choice BSL-1.0 -> not allowed
    choice Zlib -> allowed
    choice MIT + mit-0 -> not allowed
  nested: ((MIT|Apache-2.0)&(BSD-2-Clause|BSD-3-Clause))|AGPL-3.0-only
    simplified: AGPL-3.0-only|((Apache-2.0|MIT)&(BSD-2-Clause|BSD-3-Clause))
    choice AGPL-3.0-only -> not allowed
    choice Apache-2.0 + BSD-2-Clause -> allowed
    choice Apache-2.0 + BSD-3-Clause -> allowed
    choice BSD-2-Clause + MIT -> allowed
    choice BSD-3-Clause + MIT -> allowed
  oddball: error ParseError: Invalid expression
  twin: MIT|MIT
    simplified: MIT
    choice MIT -> allowed
  bracketed: Apache-2.0
    simplified: Apache-2.0
    choice Apache-2.0 -> allowed
  weird: error ValueError: WITH at position 4 has no exception
  nolicence: NOASSERTION
    simplified: NOASSERTION
    choice NOASSERTION -> not allowed
  alone: error ValueError: WITH at position 0 does not follow a licence
  redundant: (MIT&Apache-2.0)|MIT
    simplified: MIT
    choice MIT -> allowed
  three: (Unlicense|0BSD)&(MIT|CC0-1.0)&(Zlib|ISC)
    simplified: (0BSD|Unlicense)&(CC0-1.0|MIT)&(ISC|Zlib)
    choice 0BSD + CC0-1.0 + ISC -> not allowed
    choice 0BSD + CC0-1.0 + Zlib -> not allowed
    choice 0BSD + ISC + MIT -> allowed
    choice 0BSD + MIT + Zlib -> allowed
    choice CC0-1.0 + ISC + Unlicense -> not allowed
    choice CC0-1.0 + Unlicense + Zlib -> not allowed
    choice ISC + MIT + Unlicense -> allowed
    choice MIT + Unlicense + Zlib -> allowed
